vailable for future paid buyers."},"buyServers(uint256)":{"notice":"Buy `count` servers at a flat 0.001 BNB each. Servers         arrive immediately, and so does the bonus: exactly         1,000 CACHE per server, minted to the buyer inside         this same transaction, from the published 777,000         CACHE bonus reserve. Proceeds are forwarded to the         dev wallet and any overpayment refunded in the same         transaction. Requires a Binance Agent ID and that the         gate has opened; paid sales have no time limit and         end only when the paid pool sells out."},"claimFreeServer()":{"notice":"Claim this wallet's one free server. Requires a         Binance Agent ID, the 24-hour free window, and         remaining free quota. Free servers receive NO bonus."},"collect(uint256)":{"notice":"Collect one server: pay exactly 0.0001 BNB and receive         all CACHE waiting in its buffer. The caller must own         the server. Production restarts from this moment         (still inside the server's own 30-day run);         uncollected production would have paused at the         3,000 CACHE buffer cap anyway."},"collectAll()":{"notice":"Collect every server the caller owns that has CACHE         waiting, in one transaction. The fee is still exactly         0.0001 BNB per collected server."},"freeWindowClosesAt()":{"notice":"When free claims close (or closed). Zero until the         gate opens."},"freeWindowOpen()":{"notice":"True while free servers can still be claimed: the         first 24 hours after the gate opened."},"gateStart()":{"notice":"When the gate opened. Zero until the dev wallet opens         it; can be set exactly once."},"lastSettled(uint256)":{"notice":"Timestamp up to which a server's production has been         settled by a collect. Production accrues from here to         the earlier of now and the server's own season end,         capped at BUFFER_CAP."},"mintedAt(uint256)":{"notice":"When this server was minted. Its personal 30-day run         ends at mintedAt + SEASON_DURATION."},"openGate()":{"notice":"Open the gate, exactly once, at this block's         timestamp. Irreversible. Free claims run for 24 hours         from this moment; paid sales run until sold out."},"paidSalesOpen()":{"notice":"True while paid servers can still be bought: from the         moment the gate opens until the paid pool sells out.         There is no time limit on paid sales."},"pendingOf(uint256)":{"notice":"How much CACHE is waiting in a server's buffer right         now: production per second since the last collect,         paused at the 3,000 CACHE cap, and frozen at the         season end."},"serverSeasonEndsAt(uint256)":{"notice":"When this server's own 30-day run ends and its         production stops forever. Zero for unminted servers."},"serversOf(address)":{"notice":"IDs of the servers `who` currently owns."},"setBaseURI(string)":{"notice":"Set the metadata base URI. Only the dev wallet, and         only before the gate opens; locked forever after."},"windowOpen()":{"notice":"True while any minting lane (free or paid) is open."}},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"BnbCacheServers.sol":"BnbCacheServers"},"evmVersion":"shanghai","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"BnbCacheServers.sol":{"keccak256":"0x20555c43899e5fe8764e31fb00a2703ffbdec23b434f05ed6aa5b80b7e29929f","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://9701638a359c6a8de78c80c223ddd3c216f6d1bb03f12af314abd5aad970ca81","dweb:/ipfs/QmUaGjuZdQWFyH1WBj9AjBXUq79a6iwQTY6tavydZAUjz8"]}},"version":1},"matchId":"58429111","creationMatch":"exact_match","runtimeMatch":"exact_match","verifiedAt":"2026-11-05T00:21:20Z","match":"exact_match","chainId":"56","address":"0x1989058Da9eb7F36E69779fCda0EA04578528570"}